  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INCREASING RESILIENCE, OWNERSHIP AND SUSTAINABLE BENEFIT FOR LUWIRE COMMUNITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of the current project are: 1) Train Community Farmers and Implement Climate Smart, Conservation Agriculture in Protected Agriculture Units (PAUs) to Increase Yields, Maximize PAU potential and Increase household food security; 2) Support Local Community Entrepreneurial Initiatives to Increase Income Generation; 3) Support Women and Girls Livelihoods and Increased Economic Stability through the Yao Crochet Project, 4) Establish 20 Economic and Social Resilience Women&#x2019;s Groups and 5) Enhance Student Learning and Teacher morale through Refurbishment of Existing Manhur School Classroom Block and Teacher Housing</narrative>
  </description>
